    "answer": {
      "short": "$3\\sqrt{10}+2\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{2}-6$\n\nExpand all four products and simplify the radical products.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2+3\\sqrt{2})(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{2})&=2\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{2}+3\\sqrt{10}-3\\times2\\\\(2+3\\sqrt{2})(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{2})&=3\\sqrt{10}+2\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{2}-6\\end{align*}$$",
